## install

to fix [Installing Teamcity build agent as a user: failed to install the service. selected account does not have enough rights](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/30718514/installing-teamcity-build-agent-as-a-user-failed-to-install-the-service-select)
```powershell
Install-Module -Name 'Carbon' -AllowClobber
Import-Module 'Carbon'
Grant-Privilege -Identity $Env:UserName -Privilege SeServiceLogonRight
```
